    "Commit": "38bbed50ab43988785996b7e61b3b69f8e9e727c",
    "CommitMsg": "Week 4: Kafka KRaft, protobuf contracts, outbox CDC, Kafka Streams, reward saga\n\n- 3-broker KRaft Kafka (RF3, minISR 2), Kafka UI, Apicurio, Debezium Connect (streaming profile)\n- Explicit topic design (scripts/kafka-topics.sh); protobuf Envelope contracts with\n  BACKWARD_TRANSITIVE checks (scripts/register-schemas.sh)\n- Non-blocking franz-go publisher with durable disk spool and replay; match events\n  with deterministic IDs and rounds; account player IDs on /ws\n- Transactional outbox (protobuf envelope) published by Debezium EventRouter\n- Java Kafka Streams: idempotent leaderboard, session windows, EOS v2, IQ HTTP, DLQ\n- Go reward saga: reserve/grant/compensate, retry topic, DLQ\n- eventcat debug/replay tool; Experiment 004; ADRs 0009-0012",
    "Author": "SanidhyaMadheshia \u003csanidhyamadheshia@gmail.com\u003e",
    "Committer": "SanidhyaMadheshia \u003csanidhyamadheshia@gmail.com\u003e"
  },
